<title>UK: Unilever sells minor African brewing stakes.</title>
<headline>Unilever sells minor African brewing stakes.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Anglo Dutch food-to-household goods group Unilever Plc said on Friday it had sold its minority interest in certain African breweries to its existing partner Heineken for an undisclosed sum.</p>
<p>The sale relates to a 15 percent stake in Nigerian Breweries Plc and a 25 percent stake in Kumasi Brewery Ltd in Ghana.</p>
<p>Unilever said  the sale price was not material in relation to its assets.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 5427717</p>
</text>
